        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond Your Wall is a meditative wall-breaking experience where you tap through emotional blocks and reveal short quotes of insight, clarity, and strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each tap, you crack the surface of the wall and a little more of yourself. Whether you’re feeling happy, gloomy, angry, or just curious, the game responds to your mood with a personalized moment of reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the wall crumble and let powerful words shine through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture your favorite breakthrough messages with the in-game camera feature and return to them anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No scores, no stress—just a few mindful minutes to breathe, reset, and feel a little more whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your mood and break your wall with purpose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap to release tension and feel the wall give way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get inspired by encouraging and original quotes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your favorites with one tap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to soothe with clean visuals and calming sound.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the wall. Feel lighter. Break the wall. Discover what’s behind it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your space to pause, reflect, and become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes a small crack is all you need to move forward.</p>",
